.TH FONT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Font \- A loaded TrueType font at one point size, returned by text_load_font()
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct Font { TTF_Font *ttf; float line_h; } Font;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A loaded TrueType font at one point size, returned by text_load_font(). A small value type: copy it freely, keep one static per size you use. A zero Font ((Font){0}, or the result of a failed load, or any Font when the engine was built without ENGINE_WITH_TTF) is valid everywhere a Font is accepted and means "the built\-in 8x8 debug font". Fonts are never freed by the game; SDL_ttf shuts down with the engine.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B ttf
the underlying font handle; NULL means the debug font
.TP
.B line_h
height of one line in pixels, as text_line_height() reports it
.SH MODULE
text (src/engine/text/text.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR text_load_font (3),
.BR text_draw (3),
.BR text_size (3),
.BR gge\-text (7),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
